{"version":2,"slug":"slow-english-listening-advanced-shadowing","videoId":"WysjrYx0LqU","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/WysjrYx0LqU","lang":"en","title":"Slow English Listening | Advanced Shadowing","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Some people [music] show their gratitude"},{"start":3,"text":"by doing things,"},{"start":5,"text":"with actions,"},{"start":7,"text":"like opening the door for others, like"},{"start":11,"text":"helping an old lady"},{"start":13,"text":"cross the street, like saying good"},{"start":17,"text":"morning, good afternoon, or good evening"},{"start":21,"text":"to a random person on the street,"},{"start":25,"text":"like my friend"},{"start":27,"text":"cooking for me,"},{"start":30,"text":"and not waking me up"},{"start":32,"text":"so that I could get a good"},{"start":36,"text":"rest. But,"},{"start":39,"text":"I do think we don't express our"},{"start":43,"text":"gratitude enough verbally."},{"start":46,"text":"To your family,"},{"start":48,"text":"to your parents,"},{"start":50,"text":"to your friends, we should get more used"},{"start":54,"text":"to expressing"},{"start":56,"text":"what exactly we're grateful for"},{"start":61,"text":"about them. If it's the support they"},{"start":64,"text":"give us, the safety we feel around them,"},{"start":69,"text":"or simply because they're there,"},{"start":73,"text":"their presence in our lives."},{"start":76,"text":"And time"},{"start":78,"text":"is the most valuable thing that we have."},{"start":83,"text":"So, just showing up, being grateful"},{"start":87,"text":"for those details"},{"start":90,"text":"is important."},{"start":93,"text":"And expressing them"},{"start":95,"text":"however you can."},{"start":97,"text":"I know for a lot of people it's"},{"start":101,"text":"difficult to express their gratitude"},{"start":104,"text":"verbally."},{"start":105,"text":"So,"},{"start":107,"text":"they'll show their gratitude in other"},{"start":109,"text":"ways."},{"start":110,"text":"[music]"},{"start":110.6,"text":"Like I said,"},{"start":111,"text":"with actions,"},{"start":113,"text":"maybe by giving things."},{"start":117,"text":"Not everybody feels comfortable"},{"start":120,"text":"expressing those things."},{"start":123,"text":"But,"},{"start":124,"text":"I encourage you to try"},{"start":127,"text":"if you don't do it often."},{"start":131,"text":"Try expressing your gratitude and"},{"start":134,"text":"showing that to someone you love today."},{"start":138,"text":"We don't always [music]"},{"start":139,"text":"know"},{"start":140,"text":"if tomorrow is assured."},{"start":143,"text":"So, say what you want to say today."},{"start":148,"text":"Why wait"},{"start":149,"text":"until"},{"start":151,"text":"we almost lose someone"},{"start":154,"text":"to then appreciate them."},{"start":157,"text":"Why do we have to wait for something"},{"start":162,"text":"terrible to happen"},{"start":165,"text":"to feel"},{"start":167,"text":"appreciative?"},{"start":168,"text":"Don't forget the small moments."},{"start":172,"text":"Don't forget to notice."},{"start":177,"text":"Now,"},{"start":178,"text":"another good question I have for you,"},{"start":182,"text":"how does traveling change the way"},{"start":186,"text":"we appreciate"},{"start":188,"text":"our homes,"},{"start":190,"text":"our lifestyles,"},{"start":193,"text":"our environment?"},{"start":196,"text":"I think"},{"start":197,"text":"when you travel,"},{"start":199,"text":"it gives you"},{"start":201,"text":"a fresh perspective."},{"start":205,"text":"A perspective that is difficult to see"},{"start":210,"text":"when"},{"start":211,"text":"you're doing the same thing"},{"start":213,"text":"and hanging out in the same spaces every"},{"start":219,"text":"day."},{"start":220,"text":"If you're enjoying this video, be sure"},{"start":222,"text":"to like it"},{"start":223,"text":"so that we can help more people"},{"start":226,"text":"grow in English."},{"start":228,"text":"And if you haven't subscribed yet,"},{"start":231,"text":"I think you'd really enjoy"},{"start":233,"text":"coming to these lessons once a week."},{"start":237,"text":"Keep enjoying the video. At least when I"},{"start":239,"text":"travel,"},{"start":241,"text":"I'm looking around"},{"start":244,"text":"at the people,"},{"start":246,"text":"at the buildings,"},{"start":248,"text":"at the trees,"},{"start":250,"text":"listening to the sounds and the language"},{"start":254,"text":"around me."},{"start":255,"text":"And I'm like, \"Wow, this place is"},{"start":258,"text":"incredible.\""},{"start":260,"text":"Even though it's exactly the same as my"},{"start":263,"text":"home country. It always makes me feel"},{"start":266,"text":"super grateful"},{"start":268,"text":"for my home country as well"},{"start":272,"text":"as the place I'm traveling in because I"},{"start":275,"text":"go home"},{"start":276,"text":"and I think,"},{"start":278,"text":"\"It's so cool here, too."},{"start":281,"text":"How did I never realize"},{"start":285,"text":"that the people here are so"},{"start":288,"text":"friendly. The food is so delicious. The"},{"start":292,"text":"culture is so rich. That's why I love"},{"start":296,"text":"traveling. What do you think?"},{"start":299,"text":"Have you ever gone to another country"},{"start":303,"text":"and appreciated it"},{"start":306,"text":"a lot more"},{"start":308,"text":"than your home country? Think about"},{"start":310,"text":"that."},{"start":312,"text":"And take that same attitude and use it"},{"start":316,"text":"where you live."},{"start":318,"text":"Notice how amazing the place you live"},{"start":323,"text":"is."},{"start":324,"text":"And why tourists would go where you"},{"start":327,"text":"live, as well. If you had to write a"},{"start":331,"text":"thank you letter,"},{"start":334,"text":"an appreciation letter"},{"start":336,"text":"to someone in your life,"},{"start":339,"text":"who would it be to?"},{"start":341,"text":"And what would it say?"},{"start":344,"text":"You see."},{"start":346,"text":"For me,"},{"start":348,"text":"um"},{"start":349,"text":"if it wasn't"},{"start":351,"text":"my friends or my family,"},{"start":354,"text":"I think it would be to all the people"},{"start":357,"text":"who were kind"},{"start":359,"text":"and patient"},{"start":361,"text":"and understanding with me"},{"start":364,"text":"when"},{"start":365,"text":"they didn't know me,"},{"start":368,"text":"they didn't know what I was going"},{"start":370,"text":"through,"},{"start":371,"text":"and they still decided to be"},{"start":374,"text":"kind."},{"start":376,"text":"I mostly think about my time in"},{"start":379,"text":"Thailand."},{"start":381,"text":"When I wasn't having a good time. When"},{"start":386,"text":"I had to be in lots of uncomfortable"},{"start":390,"text":"situations."},{"start":393,"text":"And I still remember"},{"start":395,"text":"all of the people for some reason."},{"start":399,"text":"There was nothing special or crazy about"},{"start":402,"text":"these people,"},{"start":404,"text":"but"},{"start":406,"text":"I remember them"},{"start":408,"text":"because I was going through a very"},{"start":410,"text":"difficult time."},{"start":412,"text":"And those people"},{"start":413,"text":"were kind"},{"start":415,"text":"without knowing about my situation. So,"},{"start":419,"text":"if that's what I'm most grateful for,"},{"start":422,"text":"something that"},{"start":424,"text":"those people probably don't"},{"start":427,"text":"I'm that grateful for,"},{"start":430,"text":"then imagine how you can make someone"},{"start":433,"text":"feel today"},{"start":436,"text":"just by being kind. Just by choosing"},{"start":441,"text":"to open the door for that person."},{"start":444,"text":"Choosing to smile."},{"start":446,"text":"Choosing to be patient. Choosing to"},{"start":450,"text":"give."},{"start":451,"text":"I know I will"},{"start":453,"text":"today."},{"start":455,"text":"I hope you enjoyed our little"},{"start":458,"text":"conversation."},{"start":460,"text":"This video was a little different."},{"start":463,"text":"It was a lot of improvisation."},{"start":467,"text":"Just a lot of questions that I answered"},{"start":470,"text":"on the spot."},{"start":472,"text":"And it's a lot more advanced than my"},{"start":474,"text":"regular content, but"},{"start":477,"text":"I hope you guys enjoyed this."},{"start":480,"text":"I hope"},{"start":482,"text":"I changed your perspective a little bit."},{"start":485,"text":"And I hope"},{"start":488,"text":"that you find"},{"start":490,"text":"something to be grateful for today."},{"start":494,"text":"We have meaningful conversations like"},{"start":497,"text":"this"},{"start":498,"text":"in my English community."},{"start":500,"text":"If you're interested,"},{"start":502,"text":"we speak, we connect, and we grow"},{"start":506,"text":"together. So, you can join the wait"},{"start":508,"text":"list. The community's closed at the"},{"start":510,"text":"moment, but"},{"start":512,"text":"I might be opening in a couple months."},{"start":515,"text":"So, join the wait list, so you can know,"},{"start":518,"text":"and you don't miss out on the opening."},{"start":520,"text":"If you enjoyed this video, remember to"},{"start":523,"text":"like it, and subscribe to join me every"},{"start":527,"text":"[music] week in these conversations."},{"start":530,"text":"Um I'll see you guys next week."},{"start":532,"text":"Remember,"},{"start":533,"text":"never stop [music]"},{"start":535,"text":"learning."},{"start":537,"text":"Bye."},{"start":541,"text":"[music]"}]}